{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfvavP4h7YvaKisUs5tmn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Recommendation: plan to sunset the integration. Only rebuild if you find a specific reason it's worth keeping. Talking to the four accounts is fine, but the purpose should be planning their migration, not voting on a rebuild.**\n\n**The numbers:**\n- Four of 3,100 accounts is about 0.13% usage.\n- The two engineer-days a month in upkeep ends in five months either way, because the current API shuts down. So that cost doesn't favour either option.\n- The real choice is about 30 engineer-days now, plus ongoing upkeep on the new API, versus the cost of moving four accounts off it.\n- An older provider that is shutting down its API probably isn't going to bring you new users.\n\n**The problem with the PM's plan:** if you ask customers \"should we rebuild?\", they will almost always say yes, because it costs them nothing. That answer won't help you decide.\n\n**What to do instead (this week, before any interviews):**\n1. **Find out who the four accounts are.** Check their revenue, renewal dates and how strategic they are. Check how heavily they used the integration: daily, or once or twice in 90 days?\n2. **Set a threshold.** Rebuild only if those accounts' revenue at risk clearly exceeds six weeks of an engineer's time plus upkeep, or if one of them is a strategic account.\n3. **Check alternatives.** Can they switch to an email integration you already support, a generic IMAP/SMTP connection or a tool like Zapier? Can they move to another email provider?\n4. **Then talk to them.** Ask \"If this integration ended, what would you do, and what help would you need?\" Account managers should lead these conversations.\n\n**Timing:** Decide within two to three weeks. If you sunset, give at least 90 days' notice, offer help with migration, and turn the integration off before the provider shuts down its API so it doesn't fail without warning."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3193,"cache_read_input_tokens":5019,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3193},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c9349cba-0244-45da-9f41-6e0f876f0ef7","uuid":"fa9973e0-82b4-4f1d-89f6-1375bcac2b83","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:11:55.864Z","request_id":"req_011CfvavNq4eSZsdisw6KTqS"}
